{"seq":1,"slug":"retry-and-backoff","title":"重试与退避","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/fault-tolerance-resilience-patterns/patterns/retry-and-backoff","wordCount":1828,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"重试与退避\">重试与退避</h1><p>重试是最简单、也最容易写错的韧性模式。一个 <code>for</code> 循环加一次 <code>sleep</code> 看起来无害，但正是这种天真的重试，在 AWS、Azure 多次大型事故的复盘里被列为雪崩的直接推手：当下游已经因为过载而变慢，每个客户端的重试都在给它加压，过载导致更多失败、更多失败导致更多重试，形成正反馈直到彻底崩溃。这一篇要讲的不是「要不要重试」，而是如何重试才能吸收瞬时故障、同时不把局部问题放大成全局灾难。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重试的适用前提是<strong>瞬时故障</strong>——那些重试一次大概率就会成功的错误：网络抖动、连接重置、一次恰好撞上的 GC 停顿、下游临时的局部过载。与之相对，<strong>持久故障</strong>（下游真的崩了、请求本身非法、权限不足）重试再多次也不会成功，只会浪费资源。所以重试逻辑的第一个判断永远是「这个错误值得重试吗」，而不是「重试几次」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>退避策略</th>\n<th>第 k 次重试等待</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>立即重试</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最快恢复瞬时抖动</td>\n<td>过载时火上浇油</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定间隔</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>简单可预测</td>\n<td>同步惊群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性退避</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\cdot c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>缓慢加压</td>\n<td>仍有惊群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数退避</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\cdot 2^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>快速让出压力</td>\n<td>同步客户端仍同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数退避 + 抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rand}(0, c \\cdot 2^{k})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>打散重试时刻</td>\n<td>实践推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[调用失败] --&gt; B{错误可重试?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否, 如 4xx/非法| C[立即向上抛出]&#10;  B --&gt;|是, 如超时/5xx| D{重试预算够?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| C&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[计算退避时间&lt;br/&gt;指数 + 抖动]&#10;  E --&gt; F[等待后重试]&#10;  F --&gt; G{成功?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[返回结果]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| D\">flowchart TD\n  A[调用失败] --&gt; B{错误可重试?}\n  B --&gt;|否, 如 4xx/非法| C[立即向上抛出]\n  B --&gt;|是, 如超时/5xx| D{重试预算够?}\n  D --&gt;|否| C\n  D --&gt;|是| E[计算退避时间&lt;br/&gt;指数 + 抖动]\n  E --&gt; F[等待后重试]\n  F --&gt; G{成功?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[返回结果]\n  G --&gt;|否| D</pre><h2 id=\"指数退避与抖动-为什么必须加随机\">指数退避与抖动：为什么必须加随机</h2><p>指数退避的思想是：每失败一次，下次等待时间翻倍。第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试等待 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\cdot 2^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，这样一旦下游过载，客户端会迅速拉长间隔，把压力让出去。指数增长保证了「持续失败时重试频率快速衰减」，避免线性或固定间隔那种不痛不痒的加压。</p>\n<p>但纯指数退避有一个致命缺陷：<strong>同步</strong>。如果一千个客户端在同一时刻收到了下游的失败响应（比如下游刚重启），它们会在同样的退避时刻同时重试——第 1 秒一起重试、第 2 秒一起重试、第 4 秒一起重试。下游每次刚缓过来就被同步的重试洪峰再次打垮，这叫惊群效应（thundering herd）。</p>\n<p>解决办法是加<strong>抖动（jitter）</strong>：把退避时间随机化。AWS 架构博客里经典的「全抖动」方案是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sleep</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>cap</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sleep} = \\text{rand}(0, \\min(\\text{cap}, c \\cdot 2^{k}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sleep</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cap</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，把每个客户端的重试时刻均匀打散到整个退避窗口里，让重试洪峰被抹平成平稳的细流。抖动看起来是个小细节，却是重试策略里区分「能用」和「会引发雪崩」的关键。这也是<a href=\"../practice/antipatterns\">反模式与陷阱</a>里「无抖动重试」被单列为一条陷阱的原因。</p>\n<p>抖动的强度可以分级，不同方案在「打散效果」和「保留退避下限」之间取舍不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抖动方案</th>\n<th>等待时间</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\cdot 2^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>退避完整但客户端同步，惊群风险高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rand}(0, c \\cdot 2^{k})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>打散最彻底，但可能退避得很短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c \\cdot 2^{k}}{2} + \\text{rand}(0, \\frac{c \\cdot 2^{k}}{2})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3879em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0429em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3879em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0429em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⋅</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>兼顾打散与退避下限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>装饰抖动</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>rand</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>base</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c \\cdot 2^{k} + \\text{rand}(0, \\text{base})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9324em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rand</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>保底退避不变，仅互相错开少量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>全抖动在大多数场景是稳健的默认选择；如果下游需要一个最低退避时长来真正恢复，等抖动或装饰抖动能保证「至少等这么久、但各家错峰」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试预算-给重试设上限\">重试预算：给重试设上限</h2><p>即使有了退避和抖动，单个客户端的重试仍可能在系统整体过载时累加成压垮下游的最后一根稻草。<strong>重试预算</strong>是更高层的约束：限制重试请求在总请求中的占比，比如规定「重试流量不得超过正常流量的 10%」。一旦超过这个比例，新的重试就被拒绝，宁可让部分请求快速失败，也不让重试把下游彻底淹没。</p>\n<p>重试预算的思想是把重试当成一种<strong>有限资源</strong>而非无限权利。Google 的 gRPC、Envoy 等基础设施都内置了重试预算（也叫 retry budget / retry throttling）。它和<a href=\"../degradation/load-shedding-rate-limiting\">负载卸除与限流</a>在精神上一致：在系统级别主动丢弃低价值流量来保护整体。区别在于限流管的是入站流量，重试预算管的是自己产生的出站重试流量。</p>\n<p>另一个常被忽略的维度是<strong>重试的层级叠加</strong>。如果调用链是 A→B→C，三层各自重试 3 次，那么 C 在最坏情况下会被调用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3 \\times 3 = 27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span></span></span></span></span> 次——重试在层间相乘式放大。最佳实践是只在调用链的某一层（通常是最接近用户的边缘层，或最了解幂等性的那一层）重试，其它层快速失败，避免重试次数的指数级膨胀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"重试与幂等性-安全重试的前提\">重试与幂等性：安全重试的前提</h2><p>重试隐含一个危险假设：「这次请求没成功」。但「没收到成功响应」不等于「请求没被执行」——下游可能已经处理完，只是响应在网络上丢了。在这种情况下重试一个非幂等操作（比如「扣款」「下单」），就会造成重复执行：扣两次款、下两个单。</p>\n<p>因此，<strong>只有幂等操作才能安全地无脑重试</strong>。对于天然幂等的读操作（GET）和某些写操作（按主键的 PUT），重试没有副作用风险。对于非幂等的写操作，必须先让它变得幂等——通过幂等键让下游识别并去重重复请求。这正是<a href=\"../degradation/idempotency-and-dedup\">幂等与去重</a>要系统讲解的主题。可以说，重试和幂等是一对必须配套使用的模式：重试制造重复，幂等消化重复，缺了任何一个，另一个都不安全。</p>\n<p>此外，重试必须和<a href=\"timeout-and-bulkhead\">超时</a>配合：没有超时，一次卡死的调用会让重试逻辑永远等不到「失败」信号，重试机制形同虚设。超时定义了「等多久算失败」，重试才知道何时该启动下一次尝试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重试只适用于瞬时故障；对持久故障和非法请求重试只会浪费资源，第一步永远是判断「这个错误值不值得重试」。</li>\n<li>指数退避让持续失败时的重试频率快速衰减，但必须叠加抖动来打散同步重试时刻，否则惊群效应会反复打垮刚恢复的下游。</li>\n<li>重试预算把重试当作有限资源，限制重试流量占比；并且只在调用链的一层重试，避免多层重试相乘式放大。</li>\n<li>重试制造重复请求，只有幂等操作才能安全重试——重试与<a href=\"../degradation/idempotency-and-dedup\">幂等去重</a>必须配套使用。</li>\n<li>重试依赖<a href=\"timeout-and-bulkhead\">超时</a>提供失败信号，三者（重试、超时、断路器）共同构成调用方韧性组合拳。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"重试与退避","id":"重试与退避"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"指数退避与抖动：为什么必须加随机","id":"指数退避与抖动-为什么必须加随机"},{"level":2,"text":"重试预算：给重试设上限","id":"重试预算-给重试设上限"},{"level":2,"text":"重试与幂等性：安全重试的前提","id":"重试与幂等性-安全重试的前提"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可靠性度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/fault-tolerance-resilience-patterns/foundations/reliability-metrics"},"next":{"title":"断路器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/fault-tolerance-resilience-patterns/patterns/circuit-breaker"}}